{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S01\",\"screen\":\"明明清楚要说什么，却知道有些话一旦出口，关系就可能改变\",\"source\":\"正因为太清楚，又明白有些话一旦说出口，关系就会改变，所以格外谨慎。\",\"type\":2,\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿明确说关系一旦说出口就会改变，屏幕稿改成“可能改变”，降低了结果的确定性。\"},{\"sec\":\"S10\",\"screen\":\"先前微微绷着的肩膀终于松开，胸腔一下打开。\",\"source\":\"像一直微微绷着肩膀的人，终于长长呼出一口气，胸腔一下打开。\",\"type\":6,\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿把肩膀紧绷、呼气作为听感比喻，屏幕稿移入人物叙事并去掉“像”，容易读成他实际经历了这一身体变化。\"},{\"sec\":\"S11\",\"screen\":\"不再藏着喜欢，也不再为这份感情道歉。\",\"source\":\"线：不再藏着喜欢。珠子：像之前一直压在心底的话终于说出口：「这是我的感情，我不再为它道歉。」\",\"type\":6,\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿中的“不再为它道歉”是音乐感受里的想象台词，屏幕稿将其并入人物叙事，变成他明确持有的态度，原线并没有这一层表态。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e1f43e36-a329-4c9d-8909-e6425adc0d07", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T090232935858Z", "elapsed_seconds": 234.422, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T09:06:27.377364+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "11d3b1454eda46a82a1072e0d8a766aa55615ff6805385a523bc4eb1e79aa870", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5